{"unit_id":"Komorebi3x3__dsh-reminder#card-zh","repo":"Komorebi3x3/dsh-reminder","commit":"4dfeb4847bc12e522da6c02aaaaf7c9db8e567d3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-reminder 将定时提醒接入 DSH 工具系统，并运行后台调度器检查任务。用户可用相对时间、指定日期、每天、工作日或每周某天创建提醒，也可查看未完成事项、按 ID 取消、推迟为一次性任务，并读取到期队列。到期内容保存在本地并记录到控制台，重复任务会滚动到下一次触发时间。适合希望在 DSH 对话中安排个人待办的人；无需 API 密钥或外部服务，数据存于 DSH_HOME/scheduler，未设置时使用 ~/.dsh/scheduler。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:73-180","time.js:47-107","cordis.patch.yml:5-7"]}
{"unit_id":"Komorebi3x3__dsh-reminder#card-en","repo":"Komorebi3x3/dsh-reminder","commit":"4dfeb4847bc12e522da6c02aaaaf7c9db8e567d3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-reminder adds reminders to DSH with tools and a background scheduler. Create one-off or recurring tasks; list, cancel, snooze, and retrieve due items. Supports relative times and weekly schedules. Data stays in DSH_HOME/scheduler (default ~/.dsh/scheduler); no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:73-180","time.js:47-107","cordis.patch.yml:5-7"]}
