{"unit_id":"Komorebi3x3__dsh-reminder#feature-1","repo":"Komorebi3x3/dsh-reminder","commit":"4dfeb4847bc12e522da6c02aaaaf7c9db8e567d3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-reminder 的功能「创建定时任务」：通过 set_reminder 工具按相对时间、指定日期或重复日程创建提醒，并返回任务 ID 和下次触发时间。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:73-102","time.js:47-96"]}
